{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for PetMemoryBook', 'description': 'Primary container for PetMemoryBook implementation: MyPetStory is a personalized online journal for pet owners to capture, organize, and share every special moment of their pet’s life. Users can add memories, photos, and milestones, and generate a printable scrapbook that updates automatically with all their entries. The platform allows easy sharing of a pet’s story via private or public links, creating a lasting digital and physical keepsake.', 'interfaces': [], 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "PetMemoryBook-35801 frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Add Memory",\n      "description": "Allows users to add memories with text and photos, available directly from the timeline page. Each memory can include a date, description, and multiple photos.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Timeline",\n      "description": "Displays all added memories in chronological order. Users can add new memories directly from this page. No example memories are shown by default.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Photos",\n      "description": "Dedicated page for uploading and viewing all pet photos. Uploaded photos are automatically included in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Milestones",\n      "description": "Page to add and view important milestones in the pet\\u2019s life (e.g., birthdays, first walk). Milestones are automatically included in the scrapbook.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Scrapbook",\n      "description": "A printable, digital scrapbook that automatically updates with all photos and milestones added by the user. Users can add descriptions to each entry. No example content is shown; only user-generated content appears.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Shareable Story Timeline",\n      "description": "Users can share their pet\\u2019s story timeline with family and friends via a private or public link.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Pet Profile Image",\n      "description": "On the home page, users can upload their pet\\u2019s image as a profile picture. The home page features a beautiful paw image by default until a pet image is uploaded.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#F7C59F",\n    "secondary": "#A1C6EA",\n    "accent": "#F67280"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The home page features a large, beautiful paw image as the default background and allows users to upload their pet\\u2019s profile image. Navigation includes: Home, Timeline (with Add Memory), Photos (add/view), Milestones (add/view), Scrapbook (auto-updated with all photos and milestones, allows adding descriptions), and Share. No example content is shown; all content is user-generated. The design is warm, inviting, and pet-themed, with clear calls to action for adding memories, photos, and milestones."\n}'}",
